cp-1875">解密：SCP-1875 - 古董象棋计算机</a></strong></p> <p><strong>发布时间：</strong>2019-10-10</p> <hr /> <p><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scpdeclassified:scp-3125">解密：SCP-3125 - 逃亡者</a></strong></p> <p><strong>发布时间：</strong>2019-08-31</p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-4" style="display:none"> <p><iframe frameborder="no" border="0" marginwidth="0" marginheight="0" width="330" height="86" src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com//music.163.com/outchain/player?type=2&id=31134621&auto=0&height=66"></iframe></p> <div class="colmod-block"> <ul> <li class="folded"> <ul> <li style="list-style: none">_</li> </ul> <div class="colmod-link-top"> <div class="foldable-list-container"><a href="javascript:;">查看历史歌曲</a><a href="javascript:;">(≧▽≦)</a></div> </div> <div class="colmod-content"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/never-try-to-eat-diamond-apple/html/e91b6d59edcb47df88194adde4ffedabb789e252-3200997661638665093" allowtransparency="true" frameborder="0" class="html-block-iframe"></iframe></p> </div> <div> <div class="foldable-list-container"></div> </div> </li> </ul> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-5" style="display:none"> <blockquote> <p><em>（挥手手）</em>嘿呀嘿呀，这里是<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">你啃不动的</span><strong><span style="color: blue">钻苹果</span></strong>，很高兴认识各位(*^▽^*)—<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/diamond-apple" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5190582&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609228933" alt="Diamond_Apple" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5190582)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/diamond-apple" >Diamond_Apple</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>草你这个页面标题……出来吧，埃夫特！（大雾）——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirius-dawn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5934437&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609228933" alt="Sirius Dawn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5934437)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirius-dawn" >Sirius Dawn</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>恭喜。——<span class="error-inline"><em>LeonTeflon</em> 不匹配任何一个现有的用户名</span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>？呼唤我？懂了，苹果，来做吧（肯定）。——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chris-evertworth" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6285604&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609228933" alt="Chris Evertworth" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6285604)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chris-evertworth" >Chris Evertworth</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><tt><em>人生最大的悲哀莫过于，你以为你在别人人事里是个狠人物，结果是个吃货 ——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/maybe-abs" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5540157&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609228933" alt="Maybe-ABS" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5540157)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/maybe-abs" >Maybe-ABS</a></span></em></tt></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>留个言，别人的人事真有意思。――<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-naxurt" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4423816&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609228933" alt="Dr_Naxurt" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4423816)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-naxurt" >Dr_Naxurt</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>8说了，不愧是苹果。——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/swred" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5992128&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609228933" alt="Swred" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5992128)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/swred" >Swred</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>事钻苹果，爱了（ ——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/raintree" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5375092&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609228933" alt="RainTree" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5375092)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/raintree" >RainTree</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>钻苹果，噗嗤，整个人事都好好玩哈哈哈哈——路过的<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lyrics-linn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3935168&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609228933" alt="Lyrics Linn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3935168)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lyrics-linn" >Lyrics Linn</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>别人的人事真有意思，再回头看看自己的都是些什么鬼东西&#8230;&#8230;——ID和头像都很应景的过路人<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrpasserby" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5150580&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609228933" alt="MrPasserby" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5150580)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrpasserby" >MrPasserby</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>唔，不知道说啥的我，只是想来蹭个人事页，真的很有意思。——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/krampus-of-error" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6050311&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609228933" alt="Krampus of Error" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6050311)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/krampus-of-error" >Krampus of Error</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>有一说一，钻苹果蛮不错的（蹭人事）——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href=